# ============================================================
# .gitignore for dea-sfa-tilapia-jambi
# Survey data are NOT included in this repository due to
# respondent privacy considerations (see README.md and the
# manuscript's Data Availability statement).
# ============================================================

# --- Raw and clean survey data (NEVER upload to GitHub) ---
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
data/
data_clean*/
dmu_trimmed*/

# --- RDS files (intermediate model output, large) ---
# Omit by default; add individual files to .gitignore_allow if needed
*.rds

# --- R session artefacts ---
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# --- Output folders (plots, tables, word/tex exports) ---
# These are reproducible from the scripts; no need to version-control them
Journal_2_rev/
output/
outputs/

# --- OS clutter ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Temporary / draft files ---
~$*
*.tmp
*_DRAFT*
*_OLD*

# ============================================================
# EXCEPTION: keep the setup script and helpers
# (explicitly track these even if they match patterns above)
# ============================================================
!J2_00_Helpers.R
!00_setup.R
